$" :question/worked-solution "The given repeating decimal can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6.\\overset{―}{3} & =6.333… \\\\  & =6+0.3+0.03+0.003+… \\\\  & =6+(\\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{3}{100}+\\frac{3}{1\\,000}+…).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe series in the parentheses is a geometric series with first term ${a}_{1}=\\frac{3}{10}$ and common ratio $r=\\frac{1}{10}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6.\\overset{―}{3} & =6+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{1}{r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =6+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{10}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =6+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }3(\\frac{1}{10}){(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =6+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }3{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530487 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186083285 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8813b8a0-3b5e-5cd8-a37d-6b921f2882b8" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as the Sum of a Number and a Geometric Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e8812a9-a564-5e8d-b9fd-aab9756a2ced" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529644}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1e8812a9-a564-5e8d-b9fd-aab9756a2ced" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529644} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d6ccca8-7041-5559-b4d9-4b699776cb82" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530287} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "48ea493f-b3eb-50be-9254-2549768547af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "48ea493f-b3eb-50be-9254-2549768547af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529751} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e0533ae-8c9b-5d88-9a3d-332c6cbc30b3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530331} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e2f56e2b-12fe-5ea0-baf4-7843d062a2cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{100}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530148}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e2f56e2b-12fe-5ea0-baf4-7843d062a2cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{100}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530148} :answer-field/id #uuid "c369e53d-bf0c-5e32-8b0f-d142eed515fe" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530360}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8baa6b32-f89a-5746-b5a9-ab0eb10fe7f1" :question/math-academy-id "q-351733" :question/problem "Express $0.15\\overset{―}{3}$ using a geometric series.\n\n$0.15\\overset{―}{3}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }$\n{{field-2}}$(${{field-3}}$)^{n}$" :question/worked-solution "The given repeating decimal can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.15\\overset{―}{3} & =0.153\\,33… \\\\  & =0.15+0.003+0.000\\,3+0.000\\,03+… \\\\  & =0.15+(\\frac{3}{1\\,000}+\\frac{3}{10\\,000}+\\frac{3}{100\\,000}+…).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe series in the parentheses is a geometric series with first term ${a}_{1}=\\frac{3}{1\\,000}$ and common ratio $r=\\frac{1}{10}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.15\\overset{―}{3} & =0.15+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{1}{r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =0.15+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{1\\,000}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =0.15+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{100}(\\frac{1}{10}){(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =0.15+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }0.03{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530470 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186083285 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8813b8a0-3b5e-5cd8-a37d-6b921f2882b8" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as the Sum of a Number and a Geometric Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9b723d11-d6c7-5d3e-8fea-3e5b98c838ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529964}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9b723d11-d6c7-5d3e-8fea-3e5b98c838ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529964} :answer-field/id #uuid "2377874d-27f0-5164-a2c7-cb6157512b5a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530244} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46779c75-efd5-5aa6-aa17-5ae0d3ead20c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{100}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529744}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46779c75-efd5-5aa6-aa17-5ae0d3ead20c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{100}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529744} :answer-field/id #uuid "5265f3e8-35f3-5e0a-b6c5-f7c70a42a39d" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530278} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "286b2cc1-30b8-53ae-a45a-2c71feadf867" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529667}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "286b2cc1-30b8-53ae-a45a-2c71feadf867" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529667} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa6ce5eb-1dda-5885-86ed-25c5a53741a0" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530408}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6baf96f3-d002-5d3c-bd1a-08275622d74d" :question/math-academy-id "q-351736" :question/problem "Express $0.4\\overset{―}{25}$ using a geometric series.\n\n$0.4\\overset{―}{25}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }$\n{{field-2}}$(${{field-3}}$)^{n}$" :question/worked-solution "The given repeating decimal can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.4\\overset{―}{25} & =0.425\\,252\\,5… \\\\  & =0.4+0.025+0.000\\,25+0.000\\,002\\,5+… \\\\  & =0.4+(\\frac{25}{1\\,000}+\\frac{25}{100\\,000}+\\frac{25}{10\\,000\\,000}+…).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe series in the parentheses is a geometric series with first term ${a}_{1}=\\frac{25}{1\\,000}$ and common ratio $r=\\frac{1}{100}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.4\\overset{―}{25} & =0.4+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{1}{r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =0.4+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{25}{1\\,000}{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =0.4+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{25}{10}(\\frac{1}{100}){(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =0.4+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }2.5{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186083691 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186083285 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8813b8a0-3b5e-5cd8-a37d-6b921f2882b8" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as the Sum of a Number and a Geometric Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10d7f063-6329-52d1-98ce-545b11ed7388" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{8}{9}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529610} {:answer/id #uuid "2247c761-3579-522a-9b88-06bc25446f1f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7}{10}{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529653} {:answer/id #uuid "28f30365-bcac-5b6f-8e59-f26ddfee5386" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{8}{10}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529669} {:answer/id #uuid "9afa0728-9b15-544a-93ec-951920e24b03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7}{100}{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529962} {:answer/id #uuid "f6be738e-efdb-567a-b1e8-5ceaa104f59b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7}{10}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530193}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f6be738e-efdb-567a-b1e8-5ceaa104f59b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7}{10}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530193} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ef4297c-0c05-56d2-a418-f8b435501b80" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186081077}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4d2e6148-1311-589a-937a-5889bc0f6bfe" :question/math-academy-id "q-40687" :question/problem "$7.8\\overset{―}{7}=$" :question/worked-solution "The given repeating decimal can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7.8\\overset{―}{7} & =7.877\\,7... \\\\  & =7.8+0.07+0.007+0.000\\,7+… \\\\  & =7.8+(\\frac{7}{100}+\\frac{7}{1\\,000}+\\frac{7}{10\\,000}+…).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe series in the parentheses is a geometric series with first term ${a}_{1}=\\frac{7}{100}$ and common ratio $r=\\frac{1}{10}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7.8\\overset{―}{7} & =7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{1}{r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7}{100}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n-1} \\\\  & =7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7\\cdot 10}{100}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n} \\\\  & =7.8+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{7}{10}{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530477 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186083284 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "367fe9fb-9d92-5105-9959-f3861994aa3c" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as an Infinite Geometric Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "475de52c-5657-5af5-ae34-ca7e754e0266" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }0.28{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529746} {:answer/id #uuid "54ebaf0b-0832-5b0f-abdf-3dea0a1bc5f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }28{(\\frac{1}{1\\,000})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529783} {:answer/id #uuid "55e74a14-47f8-5c9a-8794-7907bf68812c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }2.8{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529787} {:answer/id #uuid "934ac02a-2aad-58b3-8ca6-9b0482520b23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }28{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529939} {:answer/id #uuid "fdad61af-1c9c-5960-9c78-925623f0b799" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }2.8{(\\frac{1}{10})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "55e74a14-47f8-5c9a-8794-7907bf68812c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }2.8{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529787} :answer-field/id #uuid "ef71e6d7-8cd0-5dfb-9642-a9a48b08e037" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530396}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "72d8f071-152f-5433-92b1-acd921a8a499" :question/math-academy-id "q-5403" :question/problem "$0.0\\overset{―}{28}=$" :question/worked-solution "The given repeating decimal can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.0\\overset{―}{28} & =0.028\\,282\\,8...… \\\\  & =0.028+0.000\\,28+0.000\\,002\\,8+… \\\\  & ={{\\frac{28}{1\\,000}+\\frac{28}{100\\,000}+\\frac{28}{10\\,000\\,000}+⋯.}_{⏟}}_{\\text{geometric series}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that we have a geometric series where the first term ${a}_{1}=\\frac{28}{1\\,000}$ and the common ratio is $r=\\frac{1}{100}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.0\\overset{―}{28} & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{1}{r}^{n-1} \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{28}{1\\,000}{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n-1} \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{28}{10}(\\frac{1}{100}){(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n-1} \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }2.8{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530533 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186083284 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "367fe9fb-9d92-5105-9959-f3861994aa3c" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as an Infinite Geometric Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19567227-ffd8-5f26-8518-5575ec8e1196" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }90{(\\frac{1}{100})}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529628} {:answer/id #uuid "28e1458a-1fad-5150-980b-01889f8bfc83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty